  "backstory": "Was from a family of monster hunters (Like the Belmots from castlevania)\nNot a noble house just a family with self imposed duty, to keep true to the founder of Luminos legacy\nThey use Velyron as their family symbol\nLife was good until the red wedding \nwhere my brother was to marry someone from a  luminous noble house or influencal family\nbut it was a roose, to get us to drop our guard for the night to kill us all\nduring which I was kept safe by my mother teleporting me away\nafter this raised by the grandma as we lived in hiding, until I left that after my care grandma died a natural death\nworked as a adventuror to deal with the monster and other planar creatures ",
